With an extra wish running around, and no bags in the shop in the mine town,
I thought I'd use a wish to procure a blessed bag of holding.  After a few
rubs on my blessed magic lamp, *poof* I produced a djinni, who (as expected)
granted me a wish, which I (as expected) used for a blessed bag of holding.
When I suddenly went to "burdened," I was a little skeptical of what was going
on.  Seems that in the bag I was presented with, there was a cursed
loadstone...

It got weirder from there.  I decided to get rid of the loadstone by dipping
it into fountains to remove the curse.  So, when I trundled back upstairs to
the first fount I could find, the following sequence ensued:

#dip S
Nothing happens.
#dip S
Nothing happens.
#dip S
You have summoned a water nymph!
The water nymph steals a cursed grey stone.

